{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32582","headline":"深愁喜友人至 · 刘沧","name":"深愁喜友人至","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不避驱羸道路长，青山同喜惜年光。\n灯前话旧堦草夜，月下醉吟谿树霜。\n落叶已经寒烧尽，衡门犹对古城荒。\n此身未遂归休计，一半生涯寄岳阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32582.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32582","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}